{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PLAY AS YOUR CAT(s) in a co-op roguelike with a dynamic day/night cycle: FIGHT during the night, recover during the day! Each run UNLOCKS new rooms, hazards, and the secrets of your home, which is being invaded by haunted appliances and chthonic monsters.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>True Co-Op</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994840/extras/224f298d8d912febb627e4cd0c20311d.poster.avif?t=1758718631\" width=616 height=282 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994840/extras/224f298d8d912febb627e4cd0c20311d.webm?t=1758718631\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encourage your buddies with friendly slaps, combine your junkits (shields, turrets, etc), cooperate to move heavy objects, pull two-cat switches, and offer high-fives. Coordination = chaos, but in a good way.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Yes, You Can (And Should) Make Mischief</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994840/extras/7126ba1e7fb4273b9ccdf06c3a09faa4.poster.avif?t=1758718631\" width=616 height=282 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994840/extras/7126ba1e7fb4273b9ccdf06c3a09faa4.webm?t=1758718631\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategic barf, tactical poop, high-precision hairballs \u2013 weaponize these classic cat &quot;gifts&quot; or be the perfect angel and delight your Human.\u00a0Either way, you'll get reactions (and sometimes perks).</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Be a Menace, Together</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994840/extras/afef6d077c0c928758d3728df45661d8.poster.avif?t=1758718631\" width=616 height=282 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994840/extras/afef6d077c0c928758d3728df45661d8.webm?t=1758718631\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with a slap, fur up, and go CATBALL. Become a rolling furball and bowl through enemies, then celebrate with a victory high-five.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build you Home</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994840/extras/d2f32df4ce337da61f315aaa166eb3b9.poster.avif?t=1758718631\" width=616 height=282 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994840/extras/d2f32df4ce337da61f315aaa166eb3b9.webm?t=1758718631\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade rooms, unlock new ones, and choose bold (or weird) decorations. Your home grows with you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Cozy Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994840/extras/e05c5f12335a3f3ab739d54e3d98ec36.poster.avif?t=1758718631\" width=616 height=282 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994840/extras/e05c5f12335a3f3ab739d54e3d98ec36.webm?t=1758718631\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A warm tale about cats protecting their Human by keeping an eldritch Gate (and the chthonic nonsense behind it) at paw's length. Follow the story, or skip it and sprint straight into the next run. It's your call!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Your Cat, Your &quot;Meow&quot;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994840/extras/052b1076973ac7798b6a4f47bb72fbf3.poster.avif?t=1758718631\" width=616 height=282 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994840/extras/052b1076973ac7798b6a4f47bb72fbf3.webm?t=1758718631\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fur patterns, hats, accessories, collars, whiskers, and purrs. Make a menace, a gentleman, a geek, or all at once, then change it all tomorrow!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3994840?t=1758718631","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994840/22b54f66568e43c62648c2758f407a78bc02ce0f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758718631","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994840/1f425468f97537813cfb589c91fe64635423d0db/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758718631","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994840/1f425468f97537813cfb589c91fe64635423d0db/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758718631","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PLAY AS YOUR CAT(s) in a co-op roguelike with a dynamic day/night cycle: FIGHT during the night, recover during the day! Each run UNLOCKS new rooms, hazards, and the secrets of your home, which is being invaded by haunted appliances and chthonic monsters.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>True Co-Op</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994840/extras/224f298d8d912febb627e4cd0c20311d.poster.avif?t=1758718631\" width=616 height=282 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994840/extras/224f298d8d912febb627e4cd0c20311d.webm?t=1758718631\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encourage your buddies with friendly slaps, combine your junkits (shields, turrets, etc), cooperate to move heavy objects, pull two-cat switches, and offer high-fives. Coordination = chaos, but in a good way.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Yes, You Can (And Should) Make Mischief</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994840/extras/7126ba1e7fb4273b9ccdf06c3a09faa4.poster.avif?t=1758718631\" width=616 height=282 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994840/extras/7126ba1e7fb4273b9ccdf06c3a09faa4.webm?t=1758718631\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategic barf, tactical poop, high-precision hairballs \u2013 weaponize these classic cat &quot;gifts&quot; or be the perfect angel and delight your Human.\u00a0Either way, you'll get reactions (and sometimes perks).</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Be a Menace, Together</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994840/extras/afef6d077c0c928758d3728df45661d8.poster.avif?t=1758718631\" width=616 height=282 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994840/extras/afef6d077c0c928758d3728df45661d8.webm?t=1758718631\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with a slap, fur up, and go CATBALL. Become a rolling furball and bowl through enemies, then celebrate with a victory high-five.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build you Home</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994840/extras/d2f32df4ce337da61f315aaa166eb3b9.poster.avif?t=1758718631\" width=616 height=282 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994840/extras/d2f32df4ce337da61f315aaa166eb3b9.webm?t=1758718631\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade rooms, unlock new ones, and choose bold (or weird) decorations. Your home grows with you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Cozy Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994840/extras/e05c5f12335a3f3ab739d54e3d98ec36.poster.avif?t=1758718631\" width=616 height=282 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994840/extras/e05c5f12335a3f3ab739d54e3d98ec36.webm?t=1758718631\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A warm tale about cats protecting their Human by keeping an eldritch Gate (and the chthonic nonsense behind it) at paw's length. Follow the story, or skip it and sprint straight into the next run. It's your call!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Your Cat, Your &quot;Meow&quot;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994840/extras/052b1076973ac7798b6a4f47bb72fbf3.poster.avif?t=1758718631\" width=616 height=282 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994840/extras/052b1076973ac7798b6a4f47bb72fbf3.webm?t=1758718631\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fur patterns, hats, accessories, collars, whiskers, and purrs. Make a menace, a gentleman, a geek, or all at once, then change it all tomorrow!</p>","developers":["Catch the Void"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/